# Favorites with six pinned catalog feeds fetched from the fake network (LWN.net answers HTTP 503): unread feeds with the
# blue dot, the bold name and "N new"; all-read feeds grey; the failing one with its problem in the warn tone. The options
# of a feed by a 3 s hold on its row and by Ctrl+O: Move down, Details, Mark all read, Unpin (asked first).
seed pin us-ars-technica
seed pin gb-bbc-news-top-stories
seed pin fr-korben
seed pin jp-nhk
seed pin us-nasa-news-releases
seed pin us-lwn-net
seed refresh
seed read gb-bbc-news-top-stories 8
seed read us-nasa-news-releases 3
seed refresh_on_open off
wait 900
expect text "Favorites"
shot 01-home
key enter
wait 500
expect state page favorites
expect state subs 6
expect text "Refresh all"
expect text "12 new"
shot 02-favorites
check favorites
key down
key down
wait 200
expect state fav_sel 2
shot 03-selected
# a 3 s hold: the cue after half a second, the options at 3 s
hold "Korben" 1500 04-hold-cue
wait 200
expect state popup none
hold "Korben" 3400
wait 400
expect state popup menu
expect text "Move down"
expect text "Unpin"
shot 05-options
check options
tap "Move down"
wait 500
expect state popup none
expect state fav_sel 3
shot 06-moved
# Ctrl+O: the options of the selected feed
key ctrl-o
wait 400
expect state popup menu
key end
key enter
wait 400
expect state popup info
shot 07-details
check details
key enter
wait 300
key ctrl-o
wait 400
key down
key down
key down
wait 200
shot 07b-options-scrolled
key enter
wait 400
expect state popup none
shot 08-marked-read
key ctrl-o
wait 400
key down
key down
key enter
wait 400
expect state popup confirm
expect text "Unpin this feed?"
shot 09-unpin-confirm
tap "Unpin"
wait 500
expect state subs 5
shot 10-unpinned
# the problem of a feed that failed, in plain words
key end
wait 300
expect text "Not updated: Server error (HTTP 503)"
key esc
wait 300
expect state page home
